SHA256: MEhmwVf
I used the following hashcat algorithm for the sha 256 hash password cracker - hashcat.exe hashes2.txt -d2 -w3 -a3 -m1400 -i --increment-min=7 -1=?l?d?u ?1?1?1?1?1?1?1
Here I made my own mask with a chracterset. This again only took a few minutes with teh mask and also utalizing my GPU
